ison break we  see that rob lucci is the one on the  other end and he agrees that he can't  picture kaido losing but he says there's  another order concerning the straw hats  the capture of nico robin so even if  kaido wins that's something they do want  enough to prioritize over almost  everything else right now it's not the  first time rob's chased robin but it  definitely adds even more drama to this  literal powder keg of a conflict right  now obviously this leads to the  possibility of brook getting into a big  fight in order to keep robin safe which  he hasn't had yet in this arc unlike  robin herself whose victory over black  maria was just insanely good i gotta  give props to oda for just how packed  and insane this war is right now we have  luffy fighting the strongest creature in  the world big mom fighting kid in law  zoro and sanji fighting kaido's  strongest commanders the island about to  fall and explode if kylo gets too tired  if he doesn't get too tired it's about  to land on the capital there's a  successful clone of kaido's mythical  zone fruit in momo who's aged 20 years  there's another new mythical zone in  yamato now the marines are preparing  their attack while they also target nico  robin again and that's only some of the  stuff we know so far shanks and  blackbeard are just two other of the  many hyped characters that may well show  up here as well my god what a climax  this will be it really seems all but  hopeless right now for the straw hats  because if luffy somehow beats kaido  which many people can't even imagine  then a the island might explode and b if  it doesn't the marines are going to be  waiting for them we may really need  something like shanks showing up at the  paramount war to ensure the survival of  the tired straw hats after this conflict  let me know what you expect to happen  what will save the straw hats from the  marines after they barely overcome  kaido's forces we get a quick scene of  the pervy gentleman brooke tak